**Why pharma pays:** AstraZeneca has osimertinib-refractory PTEN-null NSCLC BrM patients with no approved next-line option. They need the PTEN-null→ITGAV hypothesis validated before they can run a trial. CrisPRO has the hypothesis and the experimental design. AstraZeneca has the motivation and the budget. The research collaboration is a natural transaction.

