**At 8 briefs/year and $10M average base rNPV per brief:** The platform generates $80M/year in new asset value. At a 10x revenue multiple (comparable to Insilico, Tempus): platform value grows by $800M/year in new pipeline. The $500M Series B is not the ceiling. It is the first checkpoint.

### The Graveyard Is Infinite

500+ failed Phase III oncology trials in the public literature. Each one is a potential asset. The production loop costs $50–200K per trial to run. The average base rNPV per validated brief is $10M. The expected value per trial decoded is $10M × 0.67 (brief yield) × 0.50 (validation success) = **$3.35M per trial decoded.**

At $100K cost per trial and $3.35M expected value: **33x ROI on the production loop, before any deal is signed.**

